  and you will be playing along with that  character that sports will push that  narrative  and that intervals in that structure  you'll be able to go off into missions  as your favorite hero as you unlock them  throughout this campaign you also have  the option to play that initial setup  and then be released into the  multiplayer world where you can play  with your friends and you know up to  four characters at a time so it all  depends on how you want to experience it  but there's a really awesome strong  campaign strong story that sets up the  world sets up the characters so that you  understand what you're you know what the  stakes are when you do go into say the  co-op game so it's an only storyline and  obviously we just had something very  similar with Marvel spider-man last year  taking these characters that we know and  love so well and putting in game studios  being allowed to put their own twist on  it what's it been like was he like an  engine it what's great is that there's  so much Avengers material to look at and  we looked at it all we went back we  looked at 60 years of Avengers main  series and spin-offs we look at the  cartoon we looked at the films and  you're right we wanted to present to the  players an all-new original story so  that if they're a longtime fan there'll  be a ton of Easter eggs but if they've  just seen a few movies are retread a few  comments or I have seen nothing it's  really accessible they can jump right in  and we're gonna leave them guessing  where it's gonna where it's gonna go  next but it's so fun to to you know to  collaborate with crystal and and ask  them what kind of image of story do you  want to tell yeah and Marvel's a great  collaborator like there's so much like  well we're saying to choose from right  and then you know having someone like  Bill to just give us all the history of  it go deeper than the surface you know  stuff that you know when I thought I was  a fan and I met Belle I'm like no this  is a super fan right and then you get  all this information and you have a lot  of to pull it deep narrative out of you  know all the history all the  you know small little elections or  differences between these characters and  bring that to life it's been my pleasure  I've been working for Marvel for 21  years now and reading comics non-stop  since I was six so I better know this  stuff why we brought you on stage yeah  and talk about it on stage so it's it's  interesting because I guess anytime you  adopt a huge property like this we just  had respawn on the stage earlier and you  know they're they're kind of have a  similar challenge with oh now we have  Star Wars what do we do with it how do  you mind I nameks past and like Shawn I  know your past working on like Uncharted  Lost Legacy these 3d action adventures  how do you mine your portfolio of games  figure out how to put that into an  Avengers format well you know I think  it's for me the key is always story  right I think this is a passion we share  really strongly Marvel and Crystal and  the studio right it's it's kind of the  heartbeat at everything that we do and  like I said drawing from these  characters adding the spectacle that you  expect from Marvel right but then  keeping a very deep strong story which  you also expect for Marvel it's kind of  in the DNA of you know the partnership  which is why it works so well like  Marvel wants it we wanted and we're  merging it and still trying to keep that  on the stick feel right like so that you  feel like the Hulk so that you feel like  Iron Man so let me feel like soar and  not lose that while we're trying to just  you know get the story in it's a great  Mary and a great challenge so exactly  when we when we do a Marvel team-up with  a collaborator we always look for  someone who has vision who has the  talent and most importantly has the  passion and Krystal and the teams have  that in spades and and we care so much  about story yeah story is at the heart  of everything we do  and when you have that magic combination  of talent story gameplay and the passion  of all the teams together yeah and the  magic the fans are in the studio right  those are the fans - this is a game you  know by fans for  fans right so you know they won't let me  sleep I guarantee it right they'll tell  me hey just you know this isn't your  right this doesn't look right you know  we get it from all sides right so it's  great it's great to see it  so I mean speaking our fans the reaction  at the showcase yesterday not only to  get him see these characters in a brand  new game but the reaction when you came  out and said this game is going to be  supported with content and yes it's  gonna be free no loot boxes can you talk  about you know perhaps your  decision-making process when it came to  planning ahead for the future and how  fans are gonna be able to I mean is  there a kind of roadmap where I know  obviously Marvel hasn't announced the  new slate of movies we know a couple  that are coming are they're gonna be  direct tie-ins or is it going to be just  you know content that you guys think  makes sense in regards to the story that  you're telling I will say this we have a  roadmap of characters that we would like  to introduce into the game and regions  and really again it's number one it's  about the game itself  what mix of characters what new  characters do people want we heard  people yelling last night okay  and that was easy stay tuned true  believers yeah it's not done it's never  expanding right we're gonna it's going  to be a continuous game all right so we  have opportunities to add new characters  you know play with different storylines  and that's the thing that we're super  excited about so yeah soon become will  see and soon be review we are digging  deep into the roster yes we're thinking  about what are the immediate picks that  people will want and then we're like  let's go back into the back issues and  what about this character I think you  guys can do a really awesome version of  that so we want to surprise people with  the characters that will join well  that's what I was curious about because  just by definition the Avengers is an  ensemble cast right previous games like  Crystal Dynamics things that stick out  or Lara Croft a very like a revered  character in her own right and very  difficult to write when she has so many  fans I imagine but this like it's like  how do you get it's almost a challenge  that the Marvel Cinematic Universe that  is how do you bring all these people  together but still make each of their  arcs  meaningful yeah and then it is the same  challenge we have right and play it as  well how do you make their character  arts  you know meaningful how to make their  play meaningful how do you get enough  time with each character to understand  them feel them decide which one's your  favorite right how you level them up so  it is a continuous challenge but I think  you guys would be pretty pretty excited  to see what we're doing and and the  beautiful baked-in thing about the  Avengers is you know at its core the  wish fulfillment is assembling and if  you look at the history of the Avengers  you go back decades and their stories  what they do is they they have that  wishes one that you want of we're  different we come from different worlds  so the Avengers has the history of  bringing in different races different  ethnicities different genders characters  who used to be villains then become  heroes for the Avengers and when they  get together they may disagree and  that's okay because when a hole is  ripped in the sky and hell is pouring  down the Avengers will stand together  and they have each other's back and that  is the fantasy that we all want in this  game and in real life you want to come  together with groups and say hey we have  different backgrounds we have different  skills different abilities we may even  disagree but I got your back so what I'm  playing and getting together my friends  to play online is there gonna be you  know a character lock system there's not  gonna be you know three Iron Man's and  and a black widow or is it you know  everybody gets one you don't need you  can only have one Iron Man at a time so  you will be playing as four five four of  the core but as you progress and unlock  different looks for the heroes  your team of Avengers and your Iron Man  may be totally different from my team of  Avengers and my Iron Man we're gonna  have costumes uh uniforms based on you  know original we have original all new  costumes we're gonna have costumes based  on previously existing looks that you've  seen in the comics so you're it's gonna  be your Avengers you can put together  the team you want you get to level them  up you get to decide how they look you  get  I think a question for me is that so  last year obviously we lost the great  Stanley Stan the man Stan the man  however we know that he did record a lot  of you know cameos he was in endgame  he was reference was there any  opportunity for him to record something  for the game well we can't let you add  some talk about that right now but  obviously I mean we grew up reading the  words of Stan not only standing but the  art of Jack Kirby and Jambi Simha and  Jenner mita and so without them we  wouldn't be here they are are they are  our heroes you know we stand on their  shoulders and I mean I would say the  whole thing is is a tribute to their  work all right well Shawn bill thank you  so much for joining us we appreciate it  thanks your time hey hey true believers  out there we want to thank you for last  night for watching the trailer your  energy was awesome all the comments were  hearing we're listening to them yep  sharing happy we're taking it back to  the studios we're listening to you thank  you  [Music]  [Applause]

